# Deployment Architecture

## Topology
- Frappe Cloud Site (CRM app installed)
- Farfalle Service (separate host)
- Browser SPA (/crm) embedding chat at /crm/ai

## Networking
- HTTPS everywhere; CORS allowed origins for Farfalle → CRM if cross-origin
- Prefer server-to-server calls from Farfalle to CRM to avoid browser CSRF

## Config
- CRM whitelisted methods enabled; rate limits configured
- Farfalle env: CRM_BASE_URL, CRM_USER, CRM_PASSWORD/API_KEY, TIMEOUTS

## Observability
- Centralized logs (e.g., ELK/Grafana) for Farfalle; CRM logs via Frappe logs

## Rollout
- Phase 1: Staging site + staging Farfalle
- Phase 2: Limited-prod with RBAC; monitor
- Phase 3: Full rollout